    "Sonic's base transaction costs are typically far below Ethereum mainnet, so the bigger savings come from reducing storage writes and redundant external calls in your code.",
    "Batch multi-step user flows (approve plus deposit, or swap plus stake) into single transactions where safe.",
    "Use FeeM revenue to subsidize or sponsor user gas during launch and growth phases.",
    "Benchmark your protocol's gas profile against the same design on Arbitrum, Base, Optimism, and BNB Chain before choosing final architecture."
