{
  "query": "What should I do if a transfer into Sonic is stuck or delayed?",
  "summary": "If a transfer or bridge transaction into the Sonic network (formerly Fantom) is delayed or stuck, follow a structured verification process: confirm transaction finality on the source chain explorer, track the cross-chain message on the bridge explorer, verify your wallet's Sonic network configuration and token contract import, and escalate to official support channels if liquidity or relayer halts occur.",
