      "description": "Most transfers into Sonic rely on cross-chain messaging protocols or liquidity bridges. Use bridge-specific tracking tools to see if the message is in transit, waiting for validation, or executing: \n- Sonic Gateway: Check status via the official Sonic bridge interface or LayerZero Scan (layerzeroscan.com) if routed via LayerZero.\n- deBridge: Enter your transaction hash into deBridge deExplorer (app.debridge.finance/explorer).\n- Stargate Finance / Across / Synapse: Use their respective app dashboards or explorer tools to confirm whether relayer funds have been released."
