      "step": 3,
      "title": "Check the Sonic Network via SonicScan",
      "description": "Search your recipient address on SonicScan (sonicscan.org). A transfer may already have succeeded on-chain even if your wallet UI fails to display it. Check the 'Internal Txns' or 'ERC-20 Token Txns' tabs to verify if wrapped tokens, bridged assets, or native $S tokens were credited."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "title": "Confirm Network Configuration and Token Import",
      "description": "Ensure your wallet is connected to the official Sonic Mainnet (Chain ID: 146, Currency Symbol: S, RPC: https://rpc.soniclabs.com). If you bridged an asset like bridged USDC, USDT, or ETH, you may need to manually import the correct verified token contract address into MetaMask, Rabby, or Coinbase Wallet."
