      "description": "Third-party pool-based bridges (like Across, Synapse, or Stargate) occasionally face temporary destination liquidity shortages or paused relayers. In mint/burn bridges (such as the native Sonic Gateway), delays often stem from extended finality requirements on Ethereum L1 (typically 12-20 minutes) or scheduled bridge maintenance."
